Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 23:15:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(fsdpturbo): add synchronous training, joint checkpoint
 resume and acceptance decoupling

Add synchronous object-store training with joint trainer and data cursor
resume, and decouple acceptance-only check helpers from the production
synchronous-training path into an observability audit module.
